From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WavJaby <WavJaby@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 17:44:13 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat(angle): build the GL backend for Android

- Android.bp: cc_defaults src_libANGLE_renderer_gl_angle_gl_backend
  holds the 45 .cpp of gl/gl_backend.gni for is_android (egl/android
  included; null_functions, angle_enable_gl_null defaults to true)
- defines ANGLE_ENABLE_OPENGL and ANGLE_ENABLE_OPENGL_NULL, include
  third_party/khronos (gl/BUILD.gn angle_gl_backend_config)
- defaults src_common_linux_angle_dma_buf (DmaBufImageSiblingEGL
  includes common/linux/dma_buf_utils.h; angle_gl_backend deps it)
- angle_libANGLE takes the defaults, as libANGLE's public_deps take
  angle_gl_backend (BUILD.gn)

Upstream-Status: Pending
Patch-Reason: Android.bp is generated by gn's generator, which needs
 gn and Python; the roll config builds ANGLE Vulkan-only
 (scripts/roll_aosp.sh: angle_enable_gl = false), so the checked-in
 file has no GL backend. ATL renders GLES1 through ANGLE over its own
 GLES driver, which needs that backend.
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
 Android.bp | 62 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 62 insertions(+)

